                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This a puzzle platformer mixed with a precision platformer. And its honestly the most fun I've had playing either genre in a very long time. I hate both types of platformers with all my soul as I find them tedious, dull, and I hate repetition like you wouldn't believe thanks to my extreme lack of patience. But I actually finished the first world and enjoyed it. Probably because most of the puzzles don't take too long to figure out and I like how clever they are.\n\nI stopped after finishing the world, cuz I know it's going to get way harder and I'll get bored of it. But it's definitely worth trying out if you're actually a fan of the genre(s).",
